2127`) 确认，调用 `/work` 接口会引发应用的内存逐步分配（最高记录 48MiB，标记为 `oom_growth`）。\n3. **直接后果**：内存消耗逼近并触发硬限制，导致内核 OOM Killer 介入，容器以 137 退出码终止 (`fact-011e8dbc9f90`, `fact-3318ebc32a73`)。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 7.0m\n├─ 问题定位: 15.7s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 393.7s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-08/workload-5c9c7b6489-p8462: 393.7s (Evidence 386.7s, RCA 6.8s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 12.5s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-08/workload-5c9c7b6489-p8462**: pod-crashloop-runtime\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 421.936, "metrics": {"run_id": "ec3a09cc636347a0", "mttr": {"value": "7.0m", "seconds": 421.9398093223572, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "42%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-crashloop-runtime", "pass": true, "score": 0.9333, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.6666666666666666, "weighted_score": 0.1333}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-crashloop-runtime"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total"